"/farmland-atlas/kansas/russell-county"],["ARC or PLC in Russell County","/arc-plc/kansas/russell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025 the middle ran 32% of normal in February to March and 161% in October to November. In 2026 so far, February to March came in at 14% of normal on the middle. Grid 22624 had its driest year in 1956 at 49%.</p>"}
